+## Approximate aggregate functions
+
+Approximate aggregate functions produce statistical estimates rather than exact distinct counts, using fewer resources and less execution time on large datasets.
+
+> For best performance with approximate aggregate functions, [enable columnar storage](https://docs.cloud.google.com/spanner/docs/configure-columnar-engine) on your table (using `COLUMNAR POLICY enabled` ) and use a [columnar scan hint](https://docs.cloud.google.com/spanner/docs/query-columnar-data) (such as `/*@ scan_method=columnar */` ) in your query.
